## Title: ForeverRogueHUD2
## Notes: Rogue HUD: energy bar, energy regen, swing timer, combo points and 32 ability icons with cooldown sweeps, countdown timers and a ready flash. CTRL-drag with a grid and sticky edges, auto-hide out of combat, reflowing options window, 40 skins, named profile save/load. Text tab: font, size, outline, placement and number formats. Frames tab: player, target, target-of-target and party frames. Map tab: minimap and world map.
